cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BLE's data or findings, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Leaderboard of Benchmarks (BLE)"
abstract: >-
  BLE evaluates AI benchmarks themselves rather than the models they rank. It
  follows a deliberately small set of classic, widely followed benchmarks and
  tracks discriminative power, headroom and saturation speed, coverage and
  freshness, protocol comparability, cost and contamination resistance.
authors:
  - given-names: Yue
    family-names: Ma
repository-code: "https://github.com/yuema137/benchs-last-exam"
url: "https://yuema137.github.io/ble/"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
keywords:
  - benchmarks
  - evaluation
  - large language models
  - leaderboard
